VAR npcEmotion = "Angry"

Ah, Mr. Wade Kim, welcome to the I.M.A. I am Miss Maggie. #speaker:Maggie  
-> Start  

=== Start ===  
Hello, Miss Maggie. #speaker:Player  

You are our newest recruit. Big step, joining the I.M.A. We do not take just anyone. You must have impressed someone. #speaker:Maggie  

* Thank you. I try my best, so what do i have to know ?. #speaker:Player  
    -> Briefing  
* When do I start? #speaker:Player  
    No time to waste, huh? I like that. But first, we need to see if you have got what it takes. #speaker:Maggie  
    -> Continue  

=== Briefing ===  
Let us get you up to speed. The Information Monitoring Agency (I.M.A.) deals with intelligence, deceptive narratives, and keeping the world from falling apart. It is a big job, and you are now part of it. #speaker:Maggie  

Deceptive narratives? Like propaganda? #speaker:Player

More than that. We track, analyze, and neutralize harmful information before it spreads. And sometimes... well, sometimes we handle things more directly. #speaker:Maggie  
    -> Continue  

=== Continue ===  
Alright, time to see what you are made of. See that arcade machine over there? Go interact with it you will get a code. Then, use the console beside it to input the code. That will send you straight to the training grounds.

Pass the test, and you are in. Fail… and, well, let us not think about that. Prove yourself, Agent. #speaker:Maggie  
-> END